  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/specs and independently run all positive proof claims
  ✓ Audit adequacy, program pinning, and every local K rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  → Account for assumptions and write REVIEW.md with final verdict
